71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_Z0Ythx3xF0Q7kNvwHg88_C&_nc_oc=AdqnPHg6ZbKSwFddmKBo_xTb0G1WeTBO-Ebf70lyaxvbXcIdsj2hHLdDre5YvdbH248&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIrEWaIDbX27P0Qj6TznA807AU1lonw4Z0UzqONQjGrzA&oe=6AB672B9"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PnDD_v1ounsQ7kNvwFt3i_o&_nc_oc=AdrHvW3FbV04n8Kway4Vg30kZ4oFBGLS5gPlW11o-JzBYvqkIPE0TOYTXPu-vxDtlHM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJl_UoVZADqvhcRbKN9-oF6FJ2GABRBjxxzpYJdk5MK-A&oe=6AB68593"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PCOxE8WoTQkQ7kNvwGsuZ4r&_nc_oc=Adp1F39jqpbQ8gERP7zhiSeJNw-CNkuJa34MrI6GxrrXW70WzQOnoZN1xAWBLWwIy6E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKVINoEgTkh0p2GkNNXzOGGHrxvwCaecgYfakjeYYooVw&oe=6AB683DA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: